	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  REFCURSOR et PHP]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=4060#p4060"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Désolé Guillaume, mais il semble que le tableau soit vide.</p><p>Voici les lignes de PHP :<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $result1 = pg_query($_query);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $arr1 = pg_fetch_array($result1,NULL,PGSQL_ASSOC);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $tmp = array_keys($arr1);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $result2 = pg_query(&quot;FETCH ALL IN &quot;.$tmp[0]);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; $arr2 = pg_fetch_array($result2,NULL,PGSQL_ASSOC);</p><p>voici ce qui s&#039;affiche :<br />Warning: pg_query() [function.pg-query]: Query failed: ERROR: cursor &quot;data&quot; does not exist in /usr/local/apache....<br />Warning: pg_fetch_array() expects parameter 1 to be resource, boolean given in /usr/local/apache....</p><p>J&#039;ai ajouté : print_r(&quot;--&quot;.$_query.&quot;--&quot;);&#160; pour voir la query, et j&#039;obtiens cela :<br />--select User.Clients() as data --</p><p>Peux-tu m&#039;aider ?</p>]]></content>
